Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["GWPDeveloper", "Title",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9985935119585657`*^9},
 CellID->1899507548,ExpressionUUID->"6ac065d0-b192-4448-a5e0-536c51cd6c60"],

Cell["\<\
GWPTools provides a robust and extensible computational framework for \
constructing various types of Gaussian wavepackets (GWPs) and evaluating \
their physical properties.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998597847733357*^9, 3.998598016489842*^9}, 
   3.99860036724762*^9},
 CellID->604596826,ExpressionUUID->"e60eeb3d-c323-4fb7-94a8-6f9b4ef3ad5d"],

Cell["\<\
This Technical Note provides a comprehensive guide to the internal \
architecture and extensibility of the GWPTools framework. It details the \
design principles that strictly isolate the user-facing frontend dispatcher \
from the backend mathematical evaluators, enabling high-performance symbolic \
computation and seamless modular expansion. The document serves as a \
blueprint for developers seeking to introduce new physical paradigms, \
property classes, or potential environments into the paclet.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->356626945,ExpressionUUID->"4d6cad9f-dc35-4211-b87e-59141e31e20e"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Architecture Overview", "Section",
 CellID->531462934,ExpressionUUID->"d8e65c65-64c2-4a2a-a920-a78cd5d03c6a"],

Cell["\<\
GWPTools is engineered with a highly modular, decoupled architecture. By \
strictly isolating the user-facing frontend dispatcher from the backend \
mathematical evaluators, the framework ensures that heavy algebraic \
computations and symbolic operations evaluate with maximum performance, \
unburdened by input validation or user interface (UI) overhead.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998568062820496*^9, 3.998568069168695*^9}, 
   3.998574539313096*^9, 3.998593282842638*^9},
 CellID->913043865,ExpressionUUID->"de04db8f-e34a-4f14-8e48-7d578d0fe3a8"],

Cell["\<\
This separation of concerns also provides a highly extensible environment. \
Developers can plug new mathematical engines or property extensions directly \
into the framework without needing to rewrite any of the core parsing or \
routing logic. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.998574549805492*^9, {3.9985891668444443`*^9, 3.998589265460009*^9}, 
   3.998593290023876*^9, {3.99859499236858*^9, 3.998594992378717*^9}},
 CellID->1757581240,ExpressionUUID->"f8611ed1-dbc9-4d7d-868b-e18d1abf6fc5"],

Cell["\<\
The GWPTools framework relies on six distinct architectural components to \
achieve its modularity and performance. The specific roles of these core \
paclet files and extension modules are defined in the table below.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998595104049468*^9, 3.998595143337267*^9}, 
   3.998595240773217*^9},
 CellID->1918749385,ExpressionUUID->"893ca6ee-610b-41de-bdba-3b1ecb5cbd08"],

Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
   {Cell["GWPTools.wl", "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
     "e07d66f0-b683-46c4-ade3-868a3bb5948a"], Cell["\<\
The master paclet loader that orchestrates the loading sequence for the core \
registries, dispatchers, and stable math engines.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"a10f4548-4451-45be-9ad3-2976c32dcd50"]},
   {Cell["GWPRegistry.wl", "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
     "0940b2d8-a642-460a-b21a-5c5badd35f22"], Cell["\<\
The central database that manages dynamic properties and potential models \
(e.g., $GWPInformation and $GWPPotentialNames).\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"e1a4fba2-46d3-4eb1-9c00-d00da0e17c38"]},
   {Cell["GWPDispatcher.wl", "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
     "f22384ee-9ceb-4df2-8ee8-add25f794192"], Cell["\<\
The router that acts as the core constructor, polymorphic routing engine, and \
API overload manager for GWP and GWPObject.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"a2a89a62-74fb-42e1-909b-9c25a7362ced"]},
   {Cell["GWPDeveloper.wl", "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
     "3d784380-c0ac-4b67-9cf7-de0e2e3ef39d"], Cell["\<\
The namespace bridge that houses the universal parameter dictionary and \
developer utilities to prevent shadowing.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"6f48c2a0-829d-4eec-b1c2-10c98a90aee8"]},
   {Cell["GWPEngineTYPE.wl", "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
     "c01df45e-eaed-4fed-a950-780cb9575962"], Cell["\<\
The computational backends (e.g., GWPEngine1D) that register foundational \
physical properties and mathematical evaluators.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"23b307a8-74e2-47ed-b6ba-09606adf1197"]},
   {Cell["Extensions", "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
     "536ece47-2609-472e-aec2-67dfb81ddfb0"], Cell["\<\
Specialized subpackages (e.g., GWPHydrodynamics) that dynamically load \
alongside active math engines to inject advanced property classes.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"e6a561dd-67bb-45fd-908d-16d95ccf7d88"]}
  }]], "DefinitionBox",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9986120506584387`*^9, 3.998612053915411*^9}},
 CellID->1030336195,ExpressionUUID->"aef28ba7-5628-4b30-85a7-fbf0d71679e1"],

Cell["GWPTools architectural components.", "Caption",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998589110902543*^9, 3.9985891189887657`*^9}},
 CellID->3665970,ExpressionUUID->"f91a3a08-2650-4e58-adc2-e65bda0738d1"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Loading the Package", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998468525082096*^9, 3.998468526839287*^9}},
 CellID->288076387,ExpressionUUID->"70ecfb9a-88bb-4041-92a0-4b0274e25fa1"],

Cell["\<\
The GWPTools.wl master package executes a precise loading sequence: it \
initializes the central registry's databases, configures the dispatcher, and \
finally loads the stable math engines. The master loader's primary function \
is to expose the frontend application programming interface (API) while \
deliberately keeping the backend plumbing hidden to prevent namespace \
pollution.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9984679565616407`*^9, 3.9984679586532993`*^9}, {
   3.998568202774743*^9, 3.9985682324892817`*^9}, 3.9985746400938396`*^9, 
   3.998581489674629*^9, 3.998589305110207*^9, 3.998590803809828*^9, {
   3.998593399058519*^9, 3.998593409390148*^9}, {3.99859527090177*^9, 
   3.99859529171387*^9}, {3.998595367470559*^9, 3.998595395868992*^9}, 
   3.998599617897396*^9},
 CellID->1271695971,ExpressionUUID->"83ade23f-3c29-41ce-aa4f-a67e8e558c74"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Load the main package and check the global $ContextPath to verify that the \
registry and developer namespaces remain unexposed.\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998490872504109*^9, 3.998490878873221*^9}, 
   3.99857464953575*^9, 3.998590856082076*^9},
 CellID->1636929653,ExpressionUUID->"cc19beb5-8db9-47cb-b58d-de33c2939339"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{"Needs", "[", "\"\<GWPTools`\>\"", 
  "]"}], "\n", "$ContextPath"}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",
 CellID->463676254,ExpressionUUID->"76307be5-9ff0-4d17-b165-b0c0c4477dc7"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{"\<\"GWPTools`\"\>", ",", "\<\"WFRCrosslinks`\"\>", 
   ",", "\<\"System`\"\>", ",", "\<\"Global`\"\>"}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998587556198827*^9, 3.998587567507221*^9}, {
   3.99859086095496*^9, 3.998590871358727*^9}, 3.9986002300086403`*^9, 
   3.9986085773453608`*^9, 3.9986092544059763`*^9, 3.998611539891904*^9, 
   3.9986122033310843`*^9, {3.998640754770789*^9, 3.998640772445612*^9}},
 CellLabel->"Out[2]=",
 CellID->307045883,ExpressionUUID->"fa113758-894b-4d54-a366-be5ecdf76bc1"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
This precise loading sequence guarantees a clean namespace by channeling all \
frontend evaluations through exactly two exposed symbols in the GWPTools` \
context: the GWP constructor and the GWPObject data structure.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.998468673221427*^9, {3.998468814640826*^9, 3.998468829130414*^9}, {
   3.9985682690854187`*^9, 3.998568325556404*^9}, 3.998574673772233*^9, 
   3.998578517494637*^9, {3.998582309622693*^9, 3.998582310554665*^9}, 
   3.9985874528266573`*^9, {3.998589376455903*^9, 3.9985893863355207`*^9}, {
   3.99859090908526*^9, 3.9985909277336397`*^9}, {3.998595541826421*^9, 
   3.998595590609559*^9}, {3.998598127673911*^9, 3.998598130120277*^9}, {
   3.998599637998542*^9, 3.9985996534575663`*^9}},
 CellID->208839523,ExpressionUUID->"33ba4faa-c8e8-443a-9d21-a80d038ec2c3"],

Cell["\<\
GWP serves a dual purpose\[LongDash]first, it is the core constructor for \
generating GWPObject instances, and second, it acts as the primary interface \
for the framework's introspection capabilities. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998470025765757*^9, 3.998470027171772*^9}, 
   3.998470482155137*^9, {3.998490974762414*^9, 3.9984910029352713`*^9}, 
   3.998574700879196*^9, 3.998578555728948*^9, {3.998583924804936*^9, 
   3.998583931382736*^9}, {3.9985870980942183`*^9, 3.998587100879067*^9}, {
   3.998587146542603*^9, 3.9985872711580553`*^9}, 3.998587467576651*^9, {
   3.998589428674097*^9, 3.9985894347*^9}, 3.998590957515308*^9, {
   3.9985958880119877`*^9, 3.9985959230245543`*^9}, 3.9985963503999968`*^9, {
   3.998596489833749*^9, 3.9985965619210243`*^9}, {3.99859734799457*^9, 
   3.998597412830915*^9}, {3.9985974602236*^9, 3.998597466153274*^9}, {
   3.998597539764338*^9, 3.99859755402505*^9}, {3.998597644030095*^9, 
   3.99859764404029*^9}, {3.9985981568431873`*^9, 3.998598161136435*^9}},
 CellID->50473267,ExpressionUUID->"909a209e-e6e9-4d35-be13-c150040f106b"],

Cell["\<\
Acting as a constructor,  GWP uses a curried signature that maps directly to \
the backend architecture.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998470025765757*^9, 3.998470027171772*^9}, 
   3.998470482155137*^9, {3.998490974762414*^9, 3.9984910029352713`*^9}, 
   3.998574700879196*^9, 3.998578555728948*^9, {3.998583924804936*^9, 
   3.998583931382736*^9}, {3.9985870980942183`*^9, 3.998587100879067*^9}, {
   3.998587146542603*^9, 3.9985872711580553`*^9}, 3.998587467576651*^9, {
   3.998589428674097*^9, 3.9985894347*^9}, 3.998590957515308*^9, {
   3.9985958880119877`*^9, 3.9985959230245543`*^9}, 3.9985963503999968`*^9, {
   3.998596489833749*^9, 3.9985965619210243`*^9}, {3.99859734799457*^9, 
   3.998597412830915*^9}, {3.9985974602236*^9, 3.998597466153274*^9}, {
   3.998597539764338*^9, 3.99859755402505*^9}, {3.998597645169421*^9, 
   3.998597724068769*^9}},
 CellID->1006194250,ExpressionUUID->"6456fc5a-e985-4d46-8440-0f7037d780ee"],

Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
   {
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"GWP", "[", "type", "]"}], "[", 
     RowBox[{"parameters", ",", "options"}], "]"}], Cell["\<\
Returns a GWPObject representing a Gaussian wavepacket with the specified \
type, parameters, and options.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"7ace8e65-ab5d-40ac-a76c-7efe71a979ca"]},
   {"type", Cell["\<\
A string identifier used by the dispatcher to select a backend mathematical \
engine.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"dc22aaf4-6040-4649-9391-426907a3072f"]},
   {"parameters", Cell["\<\
A sequence of initial state variables used by the selected engine to populate \
its internal parameters.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"080b1194-a2c4-4626-be9e-0eb908a86e12"]},
   {"options", Cell["\<\
A sequence of structural modifiers that dictate the overarching behavior of \
the generated wavepacket.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"5e7ac616-227f-4452-a4fe-7bdd86a9c842"]}
  }]], "DefinitionBox",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998596222867762*^9, 3.998596275609582*^9}, {
  3.998596371117375*^9, 3.998596453459502*^9}, {3.998597207458825*^9, 
  3.998597230516926*^9}, {3.998597492403449*^9, 3.9985975161839848`*^9}, {
  3.9985977523819513`*^9, 3.998597769936178*^9}, {3.9985984985218773`*^9, 
  3.998598535311466*^9}, {3.998598844203332*^9, 3.99859886229324*^9}, {
  3.998598910503571*^9, 3.998598926979837*^9}, {3.998599586542028*^9, 
  3.998599591443162*^9}},
 CellID->1731422746,ExpressionUUID->"284784f3-d9d6-4209-aa26-3953495a3fe6"],

Cell["Primary usage statement for the GWP constructor.", "Caption",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9985965667805357`*^9, 3.9985965870694323`*^9}, {
  3.9985989389972467`*^9, 3.9985989433491707`*^9}},
 CellID->1618675172,ExpressionUUID->"cb7140d6-2baf-4b92-815c-1d6e1a6a6b05"],

Cell["\<\
In GWPTools, the term \"type\" refers to the user-facing string identifier \
(e.g., \"1D\"), whereas \"engine\" refers to the hidden backend computational \
module (e.g., GWPEngine1D.wl) that evaluates the physics for that type.  \
Because the master loader only initializes GWPEngine1D.wl by default, only \
the \"1D\" type is initially available.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9985983997230062`*^9, 3.998598441251823*^9}, {
   3.9985989739183493`*^9, 3.998599016812928*^9}, 3.998599735781123*^9},
 CellID->408076346,ExpressionUUID->"3378a199-20e4-470f-b4da-94d0f058bde1"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Construct the default 1D type GWPObject.", "MathCaption",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998599042814267*^9, 3.998599063289583*^9}, {
  3.998599138039196*^9, 3.998599163839118*^9}},
 CellID->346495330,ExpressionUUID->"a46fccbb-3ba7-46d7-ab2b-2d2aae4e89f4"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"GWP", "[", "\"\<1D\>\"", "]"}], "[", "]"}]], "Input",
