Cell["\<\
Before exploring the introspection framework, it is important to understand \
the \"Potential\" option, which serves as a critical structural parameter. It \
determines whether the wavepacket represents a static, time-independent state \
(None) or a state actively evolving under a driving force. As discussed in \
the Dispatcher section below, this single option dictates whether the \
frontend routes a query through a StaticClass mathematical signature or a \
DynamicClass mathematical signature.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998598240195633*^9, 3.998598243362821*^9}, {
   3.9985992388400297`*^9, 3.998599250727255*^9}, {3.998599284352139*^9, 
   3.99859933378964*^9}, 3.998599765327757*^9},
 CellID->1052902688,ExpressionUUID->"12316c99-1914-4ebc-a292-ec432a9ab868"],

Cell["\<\
(For a full discussion of how to use GWP and GWPObject, consult their main \
documentation pages.)\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.998470524270299*^9, {3.998568412462166*^9, 3.9985684223896103`*^9}, 
   3.998574717388752*^9, {3.998587281734415*^9, 3.998587304751361*^9}, 
   3.99858748754897*^9, {3.9985904370840397`*^9, 3.998590475113933*^9}, 
   3.9985909995284224`*^9, {3.998599347307355*^9, 3.9985994361461897`*^9}, 
   3.998599773371133*^9},
 CellID->947299039,ExpressionUUID->"f2d774bf-b7fc-438a-b48d-2d5545465ea4"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["The Introspection Framework", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.99846996061415*^9, 3.998469968651004*^9}},
 CellID->1099738708,ExpressionUUID->"e3b6b20c-a67b-4479-864b-7a5ac0a6ab94"],

Cell["\<\
GWP can be dynamically queried using simple strings to reveal exactly which \
wavepacket types and physical property classes are currently loaded into the \
framework. The registered properties can be explicitly filtered by these \
classes to reveal the specific properties available within them.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9985747287646437`*^9, 3.998584142487113*^9, 3.998587499130048*^9, 
   3.998590529137451*^9, {3.998591099611025*^9, 3.998591100048788*^9}, 
   3.998591398538353*^9, {3.99859285312131*^9, 3.9985928571141577`*^9}, 
   3.998600024554536*^9, {3.998600165761014*^9, 3.998600207652087*^9}},
 CellID->23641362,ExpressionUUID->"50569bbd-b503-4ef4-91e6-4b3dad5cc818"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Query the active wavepacket types. Initially, only the 1D type is available.\
\>", "MathCaption",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.998470580500534*^9, 3.998574739063223*^9, 3.998578624853511*^9, 
   3.998590570667098*^9, 3.998591407886278*^9, {3.9985928888463717`*^9, 
   3.9985929052565613`*^9}, 3.99859426681822*^9},
