Cell["\<\
When time evolution is suspended, static signatures perfectly mirror their \
dynamic counterparts but completely strip away the continuous time variable, \
returning immediate numerical or symbolic results.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.998513734787314*^9, 3.998575590261629*^9, 3.998608818002605*^9, {
   3.998610013624008*^9, 3.9986100315309258`*^9}},
