Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Step 6: Registry Injection", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.998576793558364*^9, 3.998576803363277*^9}, {
  3.998580335555807*^9, 3.998580336063117*^9}},
 CellID->1285593804,ExpressionUUID->"81e97078-2cda-4176-ba88-eb7ac5f64509"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
At the conclusion of the internal logic, the raw property lists and potential \
templates are packaged into the global registration functions. Properties are \
registered using a strict 6-element list containing the signature mappings, \
while potentials are registered using a 4-element list detailing the string \
aliases and frontend mapping templates. This final step injects the \
capabilities into the central registry, finalizing the dispatcher routing.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.998580586498345*^9, 3.998611855380538*^9},
 CellID->1376670239,ExpressionUUID->"e0a4028a-b47e-4956-80ab-5f13f831bf97"],

Cell["\<\
(* --- Registry Injection --- *)
  (* Format: {LongName, ShortKey, DynamicClass, StaticClass, Class, \
EngineType} *)
  $ctReg = {
    {\"Position\",        \"RX\", \"Temporal\", \"StaticValue\", \"Trajectory\
\", \"CT\"},
    {\"Momentum\",        \"RP\", \"Temporal\", \"StaticValue\", \"Trajectory\
\", \"CT\"},
    {\"KineticEnergy\",   \"KE\", \"Temporal\", \"StaticValue\", \
\"Energies\",   \"CT\"},
    {\"PotentialEnergy\", \"PE\", \"Temporal\", \"StaticValue\", \
\"Energies\",   \"CT\"},
    {\"TotalEnergy\",     \"TE\", \"Temporal\", \"StaticValue\", \
\"Energies\",   \"CT\"}
  };
  GWPRegisterExtension[$ctReg];

  (* Format: {StringName, BackendSymbol, Template, Category} *)
  $ctPot = {
    {\"Free\",     GWPCTFREE,     \"\\\"Free\\\"\",              \"Named\"},
    {\"Harmonic\", GWPCTHARMONIC, \"{\\\"Harmonic\\\", OMEGA}\", \
\"Parameterized\"}
  };
  GWPRegisterPotentials[$ctPot, \"CT\"];\
\>", "Program",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9985768273130407`*^9, {3.9985772156490726`*^9, 3.9985772183182573`*^9}, {
   3.998580598461761*^9, 3.998580601767807*^9}},
 CellID->707894095,ExpressionUUID->"6b8e2744-c5ba-41c4-b298-8281d0ec1e60"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Once the engine is fully loaded into the kernel, the frontend GWP constructor \
automatically routes queries to these newly defined evaluators.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->2111583608,ExpressionUUID->"bd119ae2-3970-40a7-9f2a-75e6cf0f0612"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

